{"version":1,"content":"<p>圈中模範夫妻袁詠儀（靚靚）與張智霖（Chilam），日前被網民目擊與20歲兒子「魔童」張慕童現身中環街頭。</p><p>不過，昔日溫馨的「三人行」畫面這次卻顯得有些微妙，袁詠儀疑似仍在與兒子冷戰，母子二人全程零交流，反觀張智霖則在後方與魔童有說有笑，盡顯</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.712695+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.715710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.715710+00:00","content_hash":"b5604ce7c1f41fa667813b9825d9db256cc3a74afae6faf2878298b4ed96ac66","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}